                           "Dispatch suspended: %s (vehicle %s). On recovery the vehicle's "
                           "position is re-verified via state before any lock is released.",
                           guard.message.c_str(), vehicle_id.c_str());
      blocked = true;  // 任一受管小车离线即挂起新派发（单车 /plan 执行模型）
